 448               /'MODIFY' AND 'MOVE' COMMANDS DIFFER ONLY IN THAT 'MOVE'
 449               /HAS A SECOND LINE NUMBER (SEPARATED BY A COMMA) WHICH
 450               /BECOMES THE LINENO OF THE CORRECTED LINE.  THE OLD LINE
 451               /REMAINS UNCHANGED IN THIS CASE.
