3317               /     INITIALIZATION: LINK IS CLEAR; MULTIPLIER IN MQ;
3318               /         MDCNT -14; MULTIPLICAND IN EMOP; HI PROD IN RMDPHI
3319               /      IF LSB OF PRODUCT IS 1 ADD EMOP TO SAVMQ
3320               /  CONSTANTS: NEG14 -14 OCTAL FOR 12 WAY SHIFT
