3719               /THIS ROUTINE EXTENDS THE FORMAT SPECIFICATIONS (%W.DD) TO
3720               /ALLOW THE NUMBER OF DIGITS PRINTED IN SCIENTIFIC NOTATION
3721               /TO BE CONTROLLED.  A FORMAT OF '0' MEANS 'ALL SIGNIFICANT
3722               /DIGITS' WHILE '.05' MEANS 'JUST PRINT 5' WITH APPROPRIATE
3723               /ROUNDING.  THIS FORMAT PRINTS A LEADING DIGIT FOLLOWED BY
3724               /A DECIMAL POINT, MORE DIGITS AND THEN THE EXPONENT.
3725               
3726               /ANOTHER IMPROVEMENT IS THAT THE MINUS SIGN IS ALWAYS OUT-
3727               /PUT JUST AHEAD OF THE FIRST SIGNIFICANT DIGIT.
